01:15:11.960 --> 01:15:14.980
Correct. Just turn on your taps and hear the rude noise of progress.

01:15:15.340 --> 01:15:17.100
Mrs. Davis, you got any photographers down there?

01:15:17.520 --> 01:15:18.600
Well, push them up here, fast.

